{"pageid": 1424, "title": "Fall of the House of Slaughter (comic series)", "revid": 2962, "categories": ["Comics", "Spinoffs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i><b>Fall of the House of Slaughter</b></i> is an upcoming four-issue mini-series horror comic book created by <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a>, who wrote and illustrated the series respectively. It is a spinoff of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, existing within the <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a>, and therefore, all issues are published by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>The world of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> is about to change. Forever.\n</p><p>Writer <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tate Brombal (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGF0ZV9Ccm9tYmFsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tate Brombal</span> (<i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i>) and artist <span class=\"new\" title=\"Adriano Turtulici (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWRyaWFub19UdXJ0dWxpY2k/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Adriano Turtulici</span> (<i>You'll Do Bad Things</i>) usher in a new era of <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">SlaughterVerse</a> as the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> is plunged into turmoil in <i>FALL OF THE HOUSE OF SLAUGHTER</i>.\n</p><p>As the House of Slaughter's Old Dragon enters his final days, <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> and the other Heads gather to determine his successor.\n</p><p>Deadly ambitions begin to take shape as the House and <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order</a> prepare for a new legacy to begin—and the conflict to determine that new legacy will be lethal.\n</p><p>Can the House of Slaughter survive a new Dragon coming into power? Find out in this all-new mini-series!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Issues\">Issues</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_.231\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_#1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 1\"><i>Fall of the House of Slaughter</i> #1</a></span></h3>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_.232\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_#2\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 2 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFsbF9vZl90aGVfSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><i>Fall of the House of Slaughter</i> #2</span></span></h3>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_.233\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_#3\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 3 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFsbF9vZl90aGVfSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><i>Fall of the House of Slaughter</i> #3</span></span></h3>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_.234\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_#4\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 4 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFsbF9vZl90aGVfSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><i>Fall of the House of Slaughter</i> #4</span></span></h3>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<center>\n<div class=\"thumb embedvideo  ev_inline autoResize\" style=\"width: 608px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo autoResize\" style=\" width: 606px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideowrap\" style=\"width: 600px;\">\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t<iframe title=\"Play video\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/Z_jVHkAhZt8?\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" style=\"border: none;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:45+00:00"}